ompilation or redistribution. Check current plan prices and limits.","attribute_id":"83353c3f-3cd2-4505-8311-f722e720867c","value_number":null,"value_boolean":null,"last_verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:00:00+08:00","verification_status":"verified"},{"confidence":0.95,"product_id":"188f3374-5440-47ba-81ad-ed0a5a74f9b5","value_enum":null,"value_text":"Native desktop local content is the offline comparison scope. Desktop and mobile feature coverage differs; Cloud sync and collaboration require connectivity. Notion HTML/Markdown import is supported but not all features map one-to-one; review converted content. Editor and EE backend licensing differ.","attribute_id":"18dee1eb-8a8a-45fa-b463-8487065642d9","value_number":null,"value_boolean":null,"last_verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:00:00+08:00","verification_status":"verified"},{"confidence":0.9,"product_id":"46d1c057-ff54-4843-a96e-fb1748f0ac49","value_enum":null,"value_text":"Local vault and Markdown note concepts require learning. Optional Sync and Publish are paid services; community extensions may add complexity. This compares basic personal notes, not full Notion databases or tested migration.","attribute_id":"18dee1eb-8a8a-45fa-b463-8487065642d9","value_number":null,"value_boolean":null,"last_verified_at":"2026-10-13T08:00:00+08:00","verification_status":"verified"}],"guardTaxonomy":[{"id":"bfda8b52-b153-4479-9c04-e46f25e6c7c0","name":"No Account Required","slug":"no-account-required","category":"account","value_type":"boolean","description":"A meaningful local/core workflow can be started without creating a vendor account."},{"id":"83353c3f-3cd2-4505-8311-f722e720867c","name":"Pricing Model","slug":"pricing-model","category":"pricing","value_type":"text","description":"Source-backed pricing model and relevant edition scope; excludes transient numeric prices."},{"id":"18dee1eb-8a8a-45fa-b463-8487065642d9","name":"Trade-Off Summary","slug":"trade-off-summary","category":"workflow","value_type":"text","description":"Evidenc